# ALLOWLIST, NOT A BLOCKLIST.
#
# This repo is public. Everything is ignored by default and only the files named below can ever
# be committed, so a stray file dropped into this folder cannot reach the open web by accident.
# Add a new line here deliberately or it does not ship.
*

!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!README.md
!*.html
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
!CNAME

# The social preview card, generated by build-site.ps1 from the live headline numbers.
# Named explicitly rather than allowing *.png: the allowlist only works while it stays tight.
# Without this line the og:image URL 404s and every shared link renders as bare grey text -
# which is what happened on the first publish of the social tags.
!og.png

# The Artifact-only copy of the home page. It has no <!doctype>, <html>, <head> or <body> -
# the Artifact publisher supplies those - so served as a real web page it renders in quirks
# mode with no charset and no viewport. index.html is the real home page; this is not.
artifact-index.html
